# Cloudflare Pages special-cases "404.html" as a redirect target (it
# triggers Cloudflare's own built-in not-found redirect instead of
# serving the file). So the form handler lives in its own file
# (form.html — same content as 404.html) and gets rewritten in place
# at 200, keeping the real slug in the URL bar.
/form/*  /form.html  200
